        <Document ID="39E6B8FA-137F-4D74-AD1E-A8352EEEE7CA">
            <Title>palace interiors</Title>
            <Text>the relation between form and function seems to dissipate. Instead the décor is an attempt to implement and layer heavy, detailed, almost decadent design elements upon one another just for the sake of beauty. Furniture is brocade silk. Every surface appears gilded, from a sidebar beneath an almost lifesized portrait to door and mirror frames, and from accents within niches to structural supports of immense crystal chandeliers. </Text>
