            <Title>Tit Virus</Title>
            <Synopsis>Cracker wakes up healthy and his face is almost healed.  He has been infected by the disc.
Sarah is very worried about the consequences. 
She tells him the discs must have done something to him, deliberately omitting to tell him about the virus.
She works out the disc is infected.
