        <Document ID="14A2DBE0-D9BB-4EBE-8E65-34CFE6492CF5">
            <Title>The Elvi</Title>
            <Text>The device I chose to challenge the power of the PTD is to use clones.  This device was required as I needed/wanted an entire class of people to pick up science and reason and run with it.  They needed them to be "blank slates" that just are immediately "true believers". Why Elvis?  I think it is just plain funny (not gut busting funny) to have Elvises everywhere writing songs about science and reason (given that Elvis himself was pretty religious or at least sang heaps of gospel songs)  His songs are generally pretty simple and are reasonably easy to alter. 

Also I like the idea of a group of evolutionary abominations coming to the defence of evolution.
It is only the intervention and interaction with "The Three Sages" (or other literary device) and the Elvi that either are able to make a difference.
</Text>
        </Document>
