            <Title>Suicide Homicide</Title>
            <Synopsis>STILL TO DO! … 

Shakti is asleep and having a dream about his blonde dream woman. He is on a beach with pure white sand and crystal blue water. Something that no-one alive had ever seen. He ws walking along the beach holding the hand of dream-woman when she suddenly turns in to his mother and she tries to drag him off to college so he can become an accountant.</Synopsis>
