            <Text>John Stoat
AKA The Johnny, The Stoat


He is a representative of the average "Airborne" citizen.  A real dick and intolerant of pretty much everyone and everything - typical wealthy a-hole. Ridiculous ego that is not matched by his ability.  A private school product who occupies a position of status just because he is airborne.

I guess this guy is a similar character to Agent Jones and perhaps they could be merged (?) somehow?</Text>
