        <Document ID="F10A8648-2FFC-4ABD-A7FC-89B2A895C4DA">
            <Title>Fin</Title>
            <Synopsis>This is setting up what appears to be a utopia.  Bio-engineered roads, urban rainforests, anti-grav technology etc - Who would want to fuck with that?
An experiment is conducted to try and create a stable stasis field and goes to shit.  The perfect world is destroyed.  How we get to that point doesn't really matter.  The perfect workd fucks the universe and the most imperfect world will fix it.</Synopsis>
        </Document>
